{"id":"n28997-1-7","stage":2,"title":"진심 · 真心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28997-1-7-1","ko":"나랑 헤어지자는 말이 진심이야?","zh":"你说要和我分手是认真的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나랑","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나랑","audio":"/audio/ba7570f9b8a80f0e0d15.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어지자는","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；자는：引用共同做某事的提议，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어지자는","audio":"/audio/ad4f56743cf36e0f5970.mp3"}},{"text":"말이","meaning":"意思","explanation":"말：意思；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이","audio":"/audio/250054307dc16bb3bc3e.mp3"}},{"text":"진심이야?","meaning":"真心","explanation":"진심：真心；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"진심","audio":"/audio/431c5321873ba8ee94a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28997","senseId":"1","lemma":"진심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진심이야","audio":"/audio/71303062bf3de2dfa608.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示再次强调或确认。","pronunciati